<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Cigar.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Cigar.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs analyst Marc Cohen said he started coverage of Consolidated Cigar Holdings Inc as market outperform.</p>
<p>-- He set share earnings estimates of $0.90 for this year and $1.17 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- &quot;There's a revival in demand for cigars. We see Consolidated positioned strongly and can grow revenues and earnings rapidly.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 7/8 to 31-3/4.</p>
</text>
